00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.050
MARK MANDEL: Oooh.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:08.290
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah, magic.

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:09.960
Magic is one of the
