00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.130
so JP Robinson, which
is a principal software

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:25.260
engineer at "The New York
Times," also a user of Go

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.967
and lover of cats wrote--

00:01:27.967 --> 00:01:29.550
MARK MANDEL: That's
the important bit.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.883
FRANCESC CAMPOY: That's his bio.

00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:33.960
Wrote a very cool
blog post explaining

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.340
how "The New York Times"
